Z||000000||costly86gt||04-10-2001||09:06 PM||||I ordered a drivers side fender for my 86 gt and sadly it does not fit! The person I got this from said it would but what I need to know is if the fenders are the same for all models and years. This is causing major problems to say the least.||||reg||5
Z||000001||FieroLisa||04-10-2001||09:10 PM||||All the fenders are interchangeable, from 84 coupe to 88 GT. But each one is slightly different, I got a coupe fender for my GT and I had to spend some time positioning it right before I competely put it in. <BR>So essentially its the same, but you may have to shift it around to get it to be right, and it may not lay in exactly the same place as before.<P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 violet pearl 4 speed GT- 17 in. rims, lowered, cold-air,<BR>AOL IM: FieroLisa<P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A><P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>Tarheels Fieros Website</A>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Tigger||04-10-2001||10:51 PM||||The overall size of the fenders are the same.  The only differences I can think of is the GT's had an added piece of rocker trim at the bottom edge.||||reg||1
